===Etymology 1===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*ḱers-}}
{{inh+|en|enm|carre}}, borrowed from {{der-lite|en|xno|carre}}, from {{der-lite|en|fro-nor|-}} (compare {{cog-lite|fro|char}}), from {{der-lite|en|la|carra}}, neuter plural of {{m-lite|la|carrum||four-wheeled baggage wagon}}, from {{der-lite|en|cel-gau|*karros}}, from {{der-lite|en|cel-pro|sc=Latnx|*karros||wagon}}. {{dbt|en|horse}}.

